    "what_en": "Adds captions to a single-subject talking-head video without editing footage. Picks from 35 styles; default is a clean rail plus one embedded peak word, with full cinematic or themed VFX on request. Runs locally, rejects bad clips, outputs final.mp4.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when asking to caption a single-speaker video: verbatim, cinematic embed, VFX, or a named style. Probes the clip, refuses multi-speaker, silent, or burned-in captions.",
